{"id":"r5r026zw6igmqhrzivl06wik7","title":"海洋全息研究：中心、临界与通道局限","originalTitle":"复杂系统科学全息观&#8226;全息海洋之中心与临界：海洋全息与通道局限（续二）","summary":"海洋复杂系统的研究强调中心、临界与通道的统一。中心决定物质、能量和信息的组织方式，通道决定整体关联的实现方式，临界则揭示系统组织状态的转变边界。研究方法应从传统的状态观测转向中心识别、通道诊断和临界检测，以实现有条件的整体重构。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3278564&do=blog&id=1561877"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T05:16:32.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T09:53:42.456Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T09:53:42.456Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["论文发表"],"score":27,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"27d62579-ee0a-4bec-a921-1fe4d18c424d","title":"海洋全息研究转向中心识别与临界检测方法论"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"27d62579-ee0a-4bec-a921-1fe4d18c424d","title":"海洋全息研究转向中心识别与临界检测方法论"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fm5bU69sTMv0","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}